026-10-14T05:10:44.534Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T05:10:45.059Z", "text": "WHAT A SHOWDOWN! On 3/10/17, the @warriors held off the @Timberwolves 103-102 behind 41% FG & 7 threes! That night, Steph Curry led the charge with 25 assists. This was just another testament to the Warriors' incredible team chemistry & ability to adapt under pressure #DubNation"}]}, {"team": "min", "query": "Timberwolves", "hour": "2026-10-14T06:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:2cdgng7zm3iewwgpg6zlhumk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxswzqbztc2o", "author_did": "did:plc:2cdgng7zm3iewwgpg6zlhumk", "handle": "choke-clutch.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T06:43:23.657Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T06:43:26.054Z", "text": "Les Timberwolves 2026-2027 peuvent aligner LaMelo Ball, Anthony Edwards, Jaden McDaniels, Jonathan Kuminga et Rudy Gobert.\n\nDu talent, de la cr\u00e9ation et une grosse pr\u00e9sence d\u00e9fensive. Mais le spacing interroge.\n\nVous titularisez Kuminga ou DiVincenzo ?"}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:2cdgng7zm3iewwgpg6zlhumk/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxswzfkio22o", "author_did": "did:plc:2cdgng7zm3iewwgpg6zlhumk", "handle": "choke-clutch.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T06:43:12.401Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T06:43:14.360Z", "text": "Minnesota vise les Finales NBA avec LaMelo Ball et Anthony Edwards. Mais les d\u00e9parts de Naz Reid et Julius Randle fragilisent la rotation.\n\nNotre pronostic : 51 victoires et 3e \u00e0 l'Ouest.\n\nUn pari gagnant pour les Wolves ?\n\nchoke-clutch.com/previews/minnesota-timberwolves-2026-2027/"}]}, {"team": "min", "query": "Timberwolves", "hour": "2026-10-14T07:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:mbs7dytl57uvv4xn5goinsqo/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxt2dsmmqs25", "author_did": "did:plc:mbs7dytl57uvv4xn5goinsqo", "handle": "progressiveweirdo.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-14T07:42:42.872Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-14T07:42:43.361Z", "text": "You should be aware that the Pistons play the Timberwolv